Package: fusion
Title: Fusion Algorithms for Product Monte Carlo
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Data generating processes, fusion algorithms (Monte Carlo
    Fusion, Bayesian Fusion, Generalised Bayesian Fusion), evaluation
    metrics, and plotting utilities used to benchmark sampling methods
    for the Product Monte Carlo (PMC) research project. Internal
    research compendium package, not intended for CRAN release.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4)
Imports:
    callr,
    DCFusion,
    expm,
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite,
    layeredBB,
    MASS,
    mvtnorm,
    patchwork,
    transport
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = FALSE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
